person.about_me:
With more than 20 years experience gained across the full spectrum of strategic and operational HR, I have delivered business focused HR solutions within a range of industries including Manufacturing, FMCG, Retail, Not-For-Profit (Wellbeing), Pharmaceuticals, and Engineering.

In particular I offer the following:

- In-depth technical knowledge, developed from hands on experience of restructuring, redundancy, culture change, talent development, driving high performance cultures, TUPE transfers, recruitment and selection;
- Senior project and change management skills, developed across a range of OD, cultural change and business transformation projects;
- Experience of developing and operating a business partnering service within a multi-site 24/7 context;
- Strong leadership, team management, and people development capability;
- Strong commercial skills and excellent stakeholder management and communication skills across all levels of the organisation;
- A record of consistently meeting or exceeding business objectives and targets;
- A strong academic background, including Chartered MCIPD and Post Graduate Diploma in Human Resource Management.

- Many years of experience in dealing with complex ER matters as well as managing a team and coaching managers, minimizing risk and financial exposure;

- Ability to influence key business decisions with stakeholders;

- Ability to demonstrate commercial awareness, understanding drivers of business performance and profitability as well as an ability to provide commercially viable and creative solutions;

- Ensure HR advice and practice are aligned to business issues and objectives - pragmatic application of best practice in people management;

- Ensure resourcing strategy in place to ensure business demands are met working within headcount budgets;
